(library
 (name arch_index)
 ; R1 — the compiler already proves a `match` arm unreachable (warning 11) and
 ; a match inexhaustive (warning 8). Relying on dune's implicit dev-profile
 ; default means the guarantee vanishes under --profile release. Make it
 ; explicit and profile-independent.
